From 6b333038e09d2fe5507d1f482dcc8e955e1e837d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dallas Delaney <dadelan@microsoft.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 17:45:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] erofs: hydrate inline signature descriptors

Verify each inline PKCS#7 annotation against its OCI descriptor, then expose the bytes through Descriptor.Data so normal content handlers materialize and retain them without redundant registry downloads.

Remote referrer discovery and manifest selection remain unchanged, preserving freshness and fail-closed bundle validation.

